---
kind: quest
id: lamplight.harl
title: The one wire
---

<quest id="telegram" title="One wire from Harl" tier="run" start="visited('timetable.harl')">
  <objective id="sent" title="Wire someone before the train leaves Harl" done="run.wired != 'none'" by="clock.index >= 3"/>
  <objective id="answer" title="Have the answer in hand at Ossery" done="visited('timetable.wireBoard') || visited('timetable.wireVarn')" on="hourStrikes" until="run.hour == 'h06'"/>
  <on event="questFailed">
    @inspector{code="0010" mono}: The whistle, and Harl slides away behind us with its one lit window. No wire, then. Only what I can see.
  </on>
</quest>
